{"v":1,"path":"/Components/IWaypointMissionManager/IWPMZManager.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>IWPMZManager</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">IWPMZManager</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><a href=\"IWaypointMissionManager.html\">IWaypointMissionManager</a><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">IWPMZManager</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.6.0</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title\">IWPMZManager</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead\">此类是航线任务编辑类，用于航线任务文件的加载，航线字段的编辑和航线任务文件生成。航线字段的含义请参考代码注释和航线文件格式。接口调用流程请参阅：航线教程。</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces\" aria-label=\"复制包名\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"描述：\" style=\"display: none;\">描述：</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">此类是航线任务编辑类，用于航线任务文件的加载，航线字段的编辑和航线任务文件生成。航线字段的含义请参考代码注释和<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://developer.dji.com/doc/cloud-api-tutorial/cn/api-reference/dji-wpml/overview.html\">航线文件格式</a>。接口调用流程请参阅：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://developer.dji.com/doc/mobile-sdk-tutorial/cn/tutorials/waypoint.html\">航线教程</a>。 <br><br><code><i>MSDK 5.6.0开始支持</i></code></font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>成员</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">6</span> 个成员</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"按名称、参数或描述筛选\" aria-label=\"筛选成员\"><button class=\"ifm-search-clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"清空搜索\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"ifm-filter-group\"><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"method\">方法</button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-groups\" id=\"ifm-groups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>方法</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">6</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_getkmzinfo_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getkmzinfo 加载 kmz 文件，获取 kmz 文件中的航线任务信息。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getKMZInfo</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">加载 KMZ 文件，获取 KMZ 文件中的航线任务信息。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfiletemplate_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"generatekmzfile 通过设置航线任务信息生成航线 kmz 文件，生成的 kmz 文件将会存储在 kmzpath 路径下。此接口生成的kmz文件包含 template 文件，可与 dji pilot 兼容使用。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">generateKMZFile</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">通过设置航线任务信息生成航线 KMZ 文件，生成的 KMZ 文件将会存储在 kmzPath 路径下。此接口生成的KMZ文件包含 Template 文件，可与 DJI Pilot 兼容使用。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfilewayline_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"generatekmzfile 通过设置航线任务信息生成航线 kmz 文件，生成的 kmz 文件将会存储在 kmzpath 路径下。此接口生成的 kmz 文件不包含 template 文件，不可与 dji pilot 兼容使用。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">generateKMZFile</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">通过设置航线任务信息生成航线 KMZ 文件，生成的 KMZ 文件将会存储在 kmzPath 路径下。此接口生成的 KMZ 文件不包含 Template 文件，不可与 DJI Pilot 兼容使用。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_checkvalidation_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"checkvalidation 对 kmz 文件中的部分字段进行检查。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">checkValidation</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">对 KMZ 文件中的部分字段进行检查。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmz_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"transkmltokmz 将 kml 文件转换为 kmz 文件。可以把 dji app 产生的历史 kml 文件转换成kmz 文件。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">transKMLtoKMZ</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">将 KML 文件转换为 KMZ 文件。可以把 DJI App 产生的历史 KML 文件转换成KMZ 文件。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmzheightmode_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"transkmltokmz 将 kml 文件转换为 kmz 文件。针对非 dji 渠道生成的kml文件转换为 kmz 文件时，需要提供高度模式。支持的高度模式有 wgs84、egm96、relative，relative 模式仅用于dji pilot 显示，开发者可以忽略。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">transKMLtoKMZ</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">将 KML 文件转换为 KMZ 文件。针对非 DJI 渠道生成的KML文件转换为 KMZ 文件时，需要提供高度模式。支持的高度模式有 WGS84、EGM96、RELATIVE，RELATIVE 模式仅用于DJI Pilot 显示，开发者可以忽略。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">没有匹配的成员，请尝试更短的关键词。</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_getkmzinfo\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_getkmzinfo_inline\">getKMZInfo</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_getkmzinfo_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getKMZInfo</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">KMZInfo</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getKMZInfo</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzPath</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">加载 KMZ 文件，获取 KMZ 文件中的航线任务信息。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmzPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>KMZ 文件存储路径。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">KMZInfo</span></code></span></td><td>返回 KMZ 文件中的航线任务信息。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfiletemplate\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfiletemplate_inline\">generateKMZFile</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfiletemplate_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>generateKMZFile</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">generateKMZFile</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzPath</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMission</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">waylineMission</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMissionConfig</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">config</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">Template</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">waylineTemplate</span>  <span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">通过设置航线任务信息生成航线 KMZ 文件，生成的 KMZ 文件将会存储在 kmzPath 路径下。此接口生成的KMZ文件包含 Template 文件，可与 DJI Pilot 兼容使用。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmzPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>KMZ 文件存储路径。</td></tr><tr><td><code>waylineMission</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMission</span> </code></span></td><td>航线文件信息。</td></tr><tr><td><code>config</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMissionConfig</span> </code></span></td><td>航线任务全局信息。</td></tr><tr><td><code>waylineTemplate</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Template</span> </code></span></td><td>航线任务信息模版类。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfilewayline\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfilewayline_inline\">generateKMZFile</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfilewayline_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>generateKMZFile</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">generateKMZFile</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzPath</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMission</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">waylineMission</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMissionConfig</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">config</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">Wayline</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">wayline</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">通过设置航线任务信息生成航线 KMZ 文件，生成的 KMZ 文件将会存储在 kmzPath 路径下。此接口生成的 KMZ 文件不包含 Template 文件，不可与 DJI Pilot 兼容使用。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmzPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>KMZ 文件存储路径。</td></tr><tr><td><code>waylineMission</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMission</span> </code></span></td><td>航线文件信息。</td></tr><tr><td><code>config</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMissionConfig</span> </code></span></td><td>航线任务全局信息。</td></tr><tr><td><code>wayline</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Wayline</span> </code></span></td><td>航线任务信息。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_checkvalidation\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_checkvalidation_inline\">checkValidation</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_checkvalidation_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>checkValidation</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineCheckErrorMsg</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">checkValidation</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzPath</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">对 KMZ 文件中的部分字段进行检查。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmzPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>KMZ 文件存储路径。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineCheckErrorMsg</span></code></span></td><td>返回 KMZ 文件中的错误信息。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmz\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmz_inline\">transKMLtoKMZ</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmz_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>transKMLtoKMZ</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">transKMLtoKMZ</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmlImportPath</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzOutPath</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">将 KML 文件转换为 KMZ 文件。可以把 DJI App 产生的历史 KML 文件转换成KMZ 文件。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmlImportPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>需要转换的 KML 文件路径。</td></tr><tr><td><code>kmzOutPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>转换后存储的 KMZ 文件路径。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span></code></span></td><td>true表示转换成功。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmzheightmode\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmzheightmode_inline\">transKMLtoKMZ</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmzheightmode_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>transKMLtoKMZ</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">transKMLtoKMZ</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmlImportPath</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzOutPath</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">HeightMode</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">transParams</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">将 KML 文件转换为 KMZ 文件。针对非 DJI 渠道生成的KML文件转换为 KMZ 文件时，需要提供高度模式。支持的高度模式有 WGS84、EGM96、RELATIVE，RELATIVE 模式仅用于DJI Pilot 显示，开发者可以忽略。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmlImportPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>需要转换的 KML 文件路径。</td></tr><tr><td><code>kmzOutPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>转换后存储的 KMZ 文件路径。</td></tr><tr><td><code>transParams</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">HeightMode</span> </code></span></td><td>高度模式。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span></code></span></td><td>true表示转换成功。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></font></font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">本页目录<